@startuml getLayerProtocolName
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getLayerProtocolName – Retrieve Layer Protocol Name
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "LayerProtocol " as lpr #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  - logicalTerminationPointUuid
end note

requestor -> lpr: (logicalTerminationPointUuid)
activate lpr

lpr -> jd: read logical-termination-point
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> lpr: LTP list with layer-protocol entries
deactivate jd

note over lpr
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Locate logical-termination-point by UUID  
  - Read layer-protocol list  
  - Extract layer-protocol-name  
  - Map to supported ONF layer protocol names  
  - Return protocol name  
  - Return undefined if not found
end note

lpr --> requestor: layerProtocolName | undefined
deactivate lpr

@enduml
